ssets/steam/apps/2273220/extras/3ddb1a7057afe4f9ffb2a1eb5d85d25e.mp4?t=1684414134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Died","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2273220/077181bc82752d0ea25c3fd2f6d550405481fc5e.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock the portal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2273220/06a2e9cf7acadd3a378279e06b2b368f7cd1c836.jpg"},{"name":"Help Carla","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2273220/d5c0af8d37b80a2c7cc7ee1a69ccbae2556055c0.jpg"},{"name":"Climb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2273220/734fb9ec7320c4e5f2acea67ea830fa47fb38f62.jpg"},{"name":"Help Gideon ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2273220/661df1a2d93b2e5185dd2febe8fb1f3d28f4767a.jpg"},{"name":"Indomitable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2273220/8de25ed4ade024d86c56a23b9ef6697bbb59158f.jpg"},{"name":"Unstoppable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2273220/d0f2bc23a42c7e90e8297418d5fdd49df528f384.jpg"},{"name":"Impregnable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2273220/1576b295e33867c0a63786c1fb723ee07d3dea80.jpg"},{"name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2273220/0e642cc855d6c51cf342864e80c50075fe4ceea9.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat???","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2273220/3e0c2a4d288a79e26ae4f1829519eb53c77a71c8.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2273220?t=1684414134","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273220/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1684414134","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1684414134","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273220/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1684414134","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2338440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273220/extras/d576dfb0425936d6df79ee0bee6bd8ae.poster.avif?t=1684414134\" width=270 height=63 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273220/extras/d576dfb0425936d6df79ee0bee6bd8ae.webm?t=1684414134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Challenge is at the core of Axium's Box, drawing inspiration from titles such as &quot;Celeste&quot; and &quot;Jump King&quot; in a fully 3D environment with stunning, cinematic graphics. If you relish in a good dose of pain, frustration, and mind-bending obstacles with a constant stream of paradigm shifts, then this game is tailor-made for you.&quot;<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273220/extras/6cc561129bce16a573adf6d30a390d7c.poster.avif?t=1684414134\" width=250 height=42 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273220/extras/6cc561129bce16a573adf6d30a390d7c.webm?t=1684414134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Jack, a man of a mystery business, finds himself whisked away to a place that's simply out of this world - quite literally, as it's floating in a dazzling nebula. Confused and bewildered, he's left with no choice but to take things to new heights or forever be a Jack stuck in a box. As he climbs he obtains new abilities and meets some truly odd characters that change his life and his climbing game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273220/extras/e1941482bf19459537eb00a6bcb7910d.poster.avif?t=1684414134\" width=250 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273220/extras/e1941482bf19459537eb00a6bcb7910d.webm?t=1684414134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>This game offers a unique and varied experience with the potential for anywhere from 4 to 40 hours of gameplay, depending on your level of skill. You'll experience a roller coaster of emotions, from triumphant cheers as you conquer difficult obstacles to despondent cries as you fall short and go tumbling down. It will be a true test of perseverance and determination.<br>As such it is also sure to create some of your fondest memories and provide both, butt-clenching entertainment, and, heart-felt belly laughter, to any watchers. <br>Axium's Box will put your skills and willpower to the test, and I hope you have the time of your life playing it. Good luck, and have fun! - LordMaddog.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273220/extras/d8cf40858dd2bc4f4a23d35a35e59901.poster.avif?t=1684414134\" width=280 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273220/extras/d8cf40858dd2bc4f4a23d35a35e59901.webm?t=1684414134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Powers you gain as you climb.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopla